  "description": "The Sportif is designed for versatility and performance. Taking geometry cues from our top-level endurance bike, the Sportif's longer wheelbase and taller headtube position the rider efficiently to reduce arm fatigue and back strain while on the road. Endurance geometry and a smart spec make the Sportif the perfect bike for local group rides, long centuries or you next charity ride. A2-SL double-butted alloy frame is both strong and lightweight. Endurance geometry puts the rider in a more upright position for enhanced comfort, easing lower back fatigue. Longer wheelbase increases stability for more confidence on the bike. Rack and fender mounts add carrying capacity and all-weather utility.",
